Package: stowaway
Type: Package
Title: Stow Files Inside Office Documents and ZIP Containers
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Zhengyang Wu", email = "wzy-amu@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Office documents (.pptx, .docx, .xlsx) and many other everyday
    formats are ZIP-based OPC containers. stowaway appends, extracts,
    removes and CRC-verifies arbitrary parts inside such containers using
    only base R: no external zip utility, no compiled code, no hard
    dependencies. Newly added parts are unreferenced by any relationship,
    so PowerPoint, Word, Excel and LibreOffice simply ignore them, and a
    presentation can carry its own raw data, analysis code or
    supplementary files as one self-contained capsule. DEFLATE streams
    and CRC32 digests are harvested from base R's gzip writer, so the
    whole implementation is pure R.
